01:00:15.660 --> 01:00:23.060
than what I do in memory. And a corollary of this is, again giving the hardware that I had 20 or 30

893
01:00:23.060 --> 01:00:25.220
years ago that random

894
01:00:25.220 --> 01:00:27.020
access to my data

